in the `notme` project (https://github.com/agentic-research/notme,
licensed under Apache License 2.0). It was lifted into cloister on
2026-05-09 and re-licensed under the AGPL-3.0-or-later license that
governs cloister as a whole, per cloister ADR-0010.

Per Apache License 2.0 §4(c), this NOTICE preserves attribution of
the work's origin. The Apache 2.0 license permitted this lift; the
original copy in notme remains under Apache 2.0 and is unaffected.
The two copies may diverge over time; see cloister bead
`cloister-9ad9eb` and notme bead `notme-9af5dd` for the divergence
plan.

